# Cloudflare Pages headers — apply to all plugin paths.
# CRITICAL: current apex https://pugame.site returns Cloudflare 403 with
# X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN, which BLOCKS bilibili iframe. Production MUST
# send ALLOW-FROM / frame-ancestors below — never DENY or SAMEORIGIN on plugin pages.
#
# Also configure Cloudflare Transform Rules / Configuration Rules so that any
# zone-level "Security Headers" or Managed Headers do NOT re-inject SAMEORIGIN.

/*
  X-Frame-Options: ALLOW-FROM https://play-live.bilibili.com/
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors https://play-live.bilibili.com https://*.bilibili.com 'self'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
